- How can I perform these checks efficiently instead of checking everything manually?
- How do I validate whether the data follows the expected **business rules**?
- Most importantly, **how do I know that the data is actually correct and useful for the business?**

### Business Value & Business Rule Validation

This is something I want to understand better.

It is not enough for a data pipeline to run successfully. I also need to ask:

> **Does the data make sense according to the business rules, and can it actually answer the business question?**

A pipeline can run without errors and still produce the wrong answer.

